ull,"fy":2024,"end":"2024-04-26","pct":0.22,"group":false,"id":"NTAP.conc.2024.5"}]},"insights":{"NTAP":[{"topic":"revenue","text":"Revenue was $6.9 billion in FY2026, up 5.4% from FY2025. In FY2015 it was $6.1 billion: the FY2026 figure is 1.1 times that.","cites":["NTAP.revenue.2026","NTAP.revenue.2025","NTAP.revenue.2015"]},{"topic":"margin","text":"Gross margin was 70.7% in FY2026 (gross profit as reported ÷ revenue), against 66.4% in FY2021. That is the highest in the years shown.","cites":["NTAP.gross.2026","NTAP.revenue.2026","NTAP.gross.2021","NTAP.revenue.2021","NTAP.gross.2015","NTAP.revenue.2015","NTAP.gross.2016","NTAP.revenue.2016","NTAP.gross.2017","NTAP.revenue.2017","NTAP.gross.2018","NTAP.revenue.2018","NTAP.gross.2019","NTAP.revenue.2019","NTAP.gross.2020","NTAP.revenue.2020","NTAP.gross.2022","NTAP.revenue.2022","NTAP.gross.2023","NTAP.revenue.2023","NTAP.gross.2024","NTAP.revenue.2024","NTAP.gross.2025","NTAP.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"rd","text":"Research and development took 14.3% of revenue in FY2026 ($991 million), against 15.3% in FY2021.","cites":["NTAP.rd.2026","NTAP.revenue.2026","NTAP.rd.2021","NTAP.revenue.2021"]},{"topic":"capex","text":"Capital spending was $198 million in FY2026, 2.9% of revenue; in FY2021 it was $162 million, 2.8%.","cites":["NTAP.capex.2026","NTAP.revenue.2026","NTAP.capex.2021","NTAP.revenue.2021"]},{"topic":"inventory","text":"Inventory at the end of FY2026 was $198 million, about 36 days of cost of revenue. The most in the years shown was about 37 days, at the end of FY2024.","cites":["NTAP.inventory.2026","NTAP.cost.2026","NTAP.inventory.2024","NTAP.cost.2024"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest segment in FY2026 was All-flash revenues: $4.2 billion, 60% of revenue.","cites":["NTAP.mix.segment.2026.0","NTAP.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest region in FY2026 was United States, Canada And Latin America (Americas): $3.5 billion, 51% of revenue.","cites":["NTAP.mix.geography.2026.0","NTAP.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest product line or market in FY2026 was Product: $3.2 billion, 46% of revenue.","cites":["NTAP.mix.product.2026.0","NTAP.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"customers","text":"The FY2026 report tags the customer it labels “Arrow Electronics, Inc.” at 22% of revenue.","cites":["NTAP.conc.2026.0"]},{"topic":"customers","text":"The FY2026 report tags the customer it labels “Tech Data Corporation” at 21% of revenue.","cites":["NTAP.conc.2026.1"]}]}}